Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Social Bookmarks|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Change Social Bookmark Sites For KB Article
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|social-bookmarks, knowledge-base|
	When Page add
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Knowledge Base Display|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Knowledge Base|
	And KBArticle add CP
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle view Via KB Display PG
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And KBArticle configure KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|enableSocialBookmarkSites|twitter,facebook,plusone,addthis,delicious,digg,evernote,linkedin,newsvine,reddit,slashdot,stumbleupon,tuenti|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And Click at locator 'Icon#SHARE'
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Twitter|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Facebook|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Google+|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|LinkedIn|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Delicious|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Digg|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Evernote|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Newsvine|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Reddit|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Slashdot|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|StumbleUpon|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Tuenti|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle view Via KB Display PG
		|kbArticleContent|Knowledge Base Article Content|
		|kbArticleTitle|Knowledge Base Article Title|
	And KBArticle configure KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|disableSocialBookmarkSites|twitter,newsvine,reddit,slashdot,stumbleupon,tuenti|
		|enableSocialBookmarkSites|facebook,plusone,addthis,delicious,digg,evernote,linkedin|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Knowledge Base Display Page|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Facebook|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Google+|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|AddThis|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|LinkedIn|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Delicious|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Digg|
	And KBArticle view Enabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Evernote|
	And KBArticle view Disabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Twitter|
	And KBArticle view Disabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Newsvine|
	And KBArticle view Disabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Reddit|
	And KBArticle view Disabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|Slashdot|
	And KBArticle view Disabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSite|StumbleUpon|
	Then KBArticle view Disabled KB Social Bookmark Sites
