Scenario: View Blogs Entry With Social Bookmarks Sites
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|social-bookmarks|
	When these properties
		|test.assert.warning.exceptions|true|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entrySubtitle|Blogs Entry Subtitle|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Blogs enable Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSites|twitter,facebook,plusone,addthis,delicious,digg,evernote,linkedin,newsvine,reddit,slashdot,stumbleupon,tuenti|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntry view Enabled Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSites|Twitter,Facebook,Google+,LinkedIn,Delicious,Digg,Evernote,Newsvine,Reddit,Slashdot,StumbleUpon,Tuenti|
	And Blogs disable Social Bookmark Sites
		|socialBookmarkSites|twitter,facebook,plusone,addthis,delicious,digg,evernote,linkedin,newsvine,reddit,slashdot,stumbleupon,tuenti|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	Then BlogsEntry view Disabled Social Bookmark Sites
